Description: Browser UI for yt-dlp and gallery-dl with a fullscreen player
 Download videos with yt-dlp and images with gallery-dl from a web page, pick
 extractors, watch anything in the browser (files the browser cannot decode are
 transcoded on the fly by ffmpeg and played with hls.js), and update yt-dlp,
 gallery-dl and hls.js with one click. Served over HTTPS (self-signed
 certificate), optional proxy, yt-dlp plugins, Kemono/Coomer through gallery-dl.
 .
 Independent of the Tk package "media-dl": own command (media-dl-web), own
 files under /opt/media-dl-web, own systemd service and port (8765).
